  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DEC Gaza emergency duty of care fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The fund will be used to support our implementing partner in Gaza as follows: -Agricultural Relief Association (PARC): our partner intends to provide direct financial support to 130 employees in Gaza to 50 displaced staff out of 130 employees. This initiative will be co-funded through other donors as well. -Juzoor for health and social development: our partner intends to provide winterization items (Blankets) to all 420 staff members in Gaza</narrative>
